text = "(THIS HINT IS FOR A PROCEDURE THAT IS NOT IMPLEMENTED)
Crystal Hint #1:
It is important to make sure you have the proper strength before attempting to grind or crush the crystal. Too much strength or too little, and the crystal is sure to break. And you will have to start all over again. I was able to confirm that having 87.5 units of strength was ideal for this procedure..."

